Z||000000||BAM-BAM||12-10-2001||12:28 AM||||  Classic Fiero Owners Group-International is trying to plan in advance for a Western National Show to be held, possibly, in Las Vegas. I am trying to get an idea as to how many might find the time to be in attendance.<BR>An accurate number is imperative in dealing with the local accomadators. This is a heavily visited place for conventions and the like and advance notice is a must. <BR>  If those who would be interested in attending a Western National Fiero Expo here in the sunny Southwest, would please take the time to respond, I would greatly appreciate it. the facilaties that I am looking into are removed from the Strip. Although its as easy as a right out of the parking lot and a left on Flamingo BLVD and 15 minutes driving to get there. These facilaties are completely self contained and very beautiful. Check it out at <A HREF="http://www.regentlasvegas.com" TARGET=_blank>www.regentlasvegas.com</A>  The room rates will be adjusted depending on rate of occupancy.<BR>  So think about it and respond....or not!<P>Peace, B2 OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||5
